# Captures are large and machine-local, so the directory contents are ignored — but the
# critic's verdicts are the record of what bar this build was held to, and they were being
# discarded along with them. Three rounds of judgements were lost to a container restart
# before anyone noticed they had never been committed. Keep the JSON, leave the PNGs out.
# (Ignore the contents, not the directory: git cannot un-ignore a file inside an ignored
# directory.)
shots/*
!shots/review-*.json
